      "markdown": "This information must be provided to the Registrar of Ineligibility and Suspension within 5 business days for all procurements, standing offers, supply arrangements, contracts or other instruments not yet awarded. The information must be provided within 22 business days for all awarded procurements, standing offers, supply arrangements, contracts and other instruments.",
