      "markdown": "If informed by the Registrar that a contractor is deemed ineligible or suspended, you must contact the Public Services and Procurement Canada (PSPC), Acquisitions Program Integrity Secretariat .",
      "plain_text": "If informed by the Registrar that a contractor is deemed ineligible or suspended, you must contact the Public Services and Procurement Canada (PSPC), Acquisitions Program Integrity Secretariat ."
