        "Integrity provisions"
      ],
      "markdown": "When a contract is terminated for default because of non-compliance with the Ineligibility and Suspension Policy clauses, you must provide the contractor with a notice period of at least 2 weeks. During this time, the contractor facing termination for non-compliance can argue their case to maintain the contract.",
